00:11:06,161 --> 00:11:08,920
and the neuron connections, how they're firing,

182
00:11:08,921 --> 00:11:11,920
starts to strengthen because it keeps doing something.

183
00:11:11,921 --> 00:11:13,920
Bit like in humans, if you do something

184
00:11:13,921 --> 00:11:15,920
habitually, you get better at doing it.

185
00:11:15,921 --> 00:11:18,920
Well, our little robot, our rat brain robot,

186
00:11:18,921 --> 00:11:20,920
is exactly the same.

187
00:11:20,921 --> 00:11:24,920
If this rudimentary gadget fusing biologic brain power

188
00:11:24,921 --> 00:11:27,920
and robotics seems a long way from super cyborgs,

189
00:11:27,921 --> 00:11:28,920
you're right.

190
00:11:28,921 --> 00:11:30,920
But his offspring promised to

191
00:11:30,921 --> 00:11:33,620
His offspring promised to be less primitive.

192
00:11:33,621 --> 00:11:37,720
The physical robot doesn't have to be small and with little wheels.

